  "note": "The reaction depth bound holds for a saga's compensation too. The Watch saga marks a lamp when it is lit, and that mark is compensable. Lamp.Flicker then triggers itself on every Flickered; the flicker the fifth reaction announces reaches the saga at the ceiling, so its leg is refused and the saga unwinds. The compensation (Unmark) and the hand-written refused leg (Retire) are reactions at that depth and are refused as well: the Lit mark stays, no Unmarked, no LampRetired.",
